# 🚀 FreeLang Self-Hosting Bootstrap HTTP Server

**REST API로 부트스트랩 증명을 서빙합니다**

---

## 빠른 시작

### 1. 서버 시작

```bash
npm install          # 의존성 설치 (최초 1회)
npm start            # 또는 node server.js
```

Expected output:
```
🚀 FreeLang Self-Hosting Bootstrap HTTP Server

📍 Server running on: http://localhost:3000
📚 API Documentation: http://localhost:3000/api/docs
🌐 Dashboard: http://localhost:3000/

✅ Ready to serve bootstrap proofs!
```

### 2. 웹 브라우저에서 접속

```
http://localhost:3000
```

### 3. API 테스트 (curl)

```bash
# 헬스 체크
curl http://localhost:3000/api/health

# 부트스트랩 증명 확인
curl http://localhost:3000/api/bootstrap

# 모든 Stage 조회
curl http://localhost:3000/api/stages
```

